    "title": "Tre Johnson Selected by Washington Wizards in 2025 NBA Draft",
    "text": "Trending Story\nUpdated 04:28 AM UTC, Thu June 26, 2025\nTre Johnson Selected by Washington Wizards in 2025 NBA Draft\nTre Johnson was selected No. 6 overall by the Washington Wizards during the first round of the 2025 NBA Draft on Wednesday night. He’s now able to live out the dream his father, Richard, had 20 years ago. Or was it 30? Richard Johnson said that his son “deserved it.” He said, “This was my dream 20 years ago — I mean 30 years ago.” Cue Tre’s laughter. “He tried to lie on his age right there,” Tre Johnson said during his post-selection interview on ESPN. His father had just tried to describe the emotions of seeing his son realize his own dream of playing in the NBA. In his father’s defense, he c...\nJay Bilas\n\"Look at that suit. … Up top, he looks like a banker. Down low, he’s like a guitarist for AC/DC.\"\nJames Fletcher\n\"Tre Johnson has been a polarizing prospect throughout the evaluation process, but his combination of size and scoring punch have brought him closer to the top of the board.\"",
